Scenic Spirit (2018)


Overview


Scenic Spirit is an original composition by Metta Legita that blends modern
jazz language with contemporary world music influences. The piece was
written for jazz ensemble, featuring both quintet and quartet
instrumentation.


Artistic Concept


The composition explores expressive melodic development and rhythmic
interplay within a modern jazz framework. By combining elements from
different musical traditions, the piece reflects Legita=E2=80=99s interest =
in
creating music that bridges stylistic boundaries.


Recording & Collaboration


Performed in a jazz ensemble setting, the recording highlights the
collaborative dialogue between musicians while showcasing the piece=E2=80=
=99s rich
harmonic and rhythmic character.


