Home With You (2019)


Overview


Home With You is a collaborative songwriting project created with Carrie
Herbert and friends. The piece explores themes of connection, belonging,
and emotional warmth through a contemporary pop-inspired sound.



Recording & Collaboration


This project brought together a group of collaborators, combining
songwriting, vocal performance, and musical arrangement to create a warm
and accessible pop composition.

------------------------------

Thank You (2021)


Overview


Thank You is a therapeutic music composition by Metta Legita inspired by
the Hawaiian Ho=E2=80=99oponopono mantra. The piece combines piano and voca=
l
elements to create a calm and meditative musical atmosphere.


Artistic Concept


Rooted in the philosophy of gratitude, forgiveness, and emotional healing,
the music invites listeners into a reflective space. The gentle piano
textures and affirmational vocal elements are designed to encourage
mindfulness and inner peace.


Recording & Collaboration


The recording centers around piano and voice, emphasizing simplicity and
emotional clarity as core elements of the piece.


Credit: Metta Legita : Vocal and Piano Carrie Herbert : Backing Vocal
Arranger and Producer : Carrie Herbert Mixing and Mastering : Tom Cory This
song is inspired by Ho=E2=80=99oponopono, a Hawaiian prayer for forgiveness=
. The
melody came to me while listening to its beautiful recurring words at the
piano.


https://youtu.be/huGacD2RsU4?si=3DNMayaO_R29xOymh9


------------------------------

I Am Love (2021)


Overview


I Am Love is a therapeutic music composition that combines piano and voice
in an affirmation-based musical experience. The piece explores themes of
self-awareness, compassion, and emotional well-being.


Artistic Concept


Inspired by meditation and positive affirmation practices, the composition
creates a peaceful sonic environment where music supports reflection and
emotional balance.


Recording & Collaboration


Featuring piano and vocal elements, the recording emphasizes clarity,
calmness, and expressive simplicity to support the meditative character of
the piece.


Credit: Metta Legita : Vocal and Piano Carrie Herbert : Backing Vocal
Arranger and Producer : Carrie Herbert Mixing and Mastering : Tom Cory


https://youtu.be/fuWqjiNqoGY?si=3DMeFZ08KKJ2FdccwM

------------------------------

Kala Senja Menghilang (2020)


Overview


Kala Senja Menghilang is a collaborative musical project between Indonesian
band The Panic and pianist Metta Legita. The piece blends contemporary band
sound with expressive piano elements.


Artistic Concept


The music evokes the atmosphere of twilight and transition suggested by its
title (=E2=80=9CWhen the dusk disappears=E2=80=9D). Through lyrical melodie=
s and expressive
textures, the piece captures a reflective and emotional mood.


Recording & Collaboration


The recording features collaboration with the Indonesian band The Panic,
combining band instrumentation with Legita=E2=80=99s piano performance to c=
reate a
rich musical dialogue.

------------------------------

Cikaracak (2021)


Overview


Cikaracak is a flute and piano composition created by Metta Legita in
collaboration with Jennifer Bird. The project was released as part of a
mini album during the global COVID period.


Artistic Concept


Inspired by Indonesian musical imagery and natural rhythmic patterns, the
piece explores the expressive interaction between flute and piano. The
music reflects a sense of calm reflection during a time of global
uncertainty.


Recording & Collaboration


The recording features flute and piano, highlighting the intimate chamber
music dialogue between the two instruments.


