Bertemu di Hari Raya (2022)


Overview


Bertemu di Hari Raya is a collaborative musical project created with
vocalist Sharliza Jelita. The song celebrates themes of reunion,
celebration, and cultural connection.


Artistic Concept


Inspired by the festive atmosphere of Hari Raya, the piece reflects the joy
of meeting loved ones and celebrating shared traditions through music.


Recording & Collaboration


The project features collaboration with vocalist Sharliza Jelita, combining
vocal performance with Legita=E2=80=99s musical composition and arrangement=
.


