Contra Indigo (2010)


A groove-driven band project from Bandung blending pop, jazz, and funk
influences. Contra Indigo brought together a group of young musicians,
including Metta Legita, and earned a nomination at the Anugerah Musik
Indonesia while performing across Indonesia, including the renowned Java
Jazz Festival.

